Fig.~\ref{fig:convergence} shows the average weighted sum rate versus the
outer AO iteration index $\tau_0$ for three antenna--RIS configurations,
together with a benchmark in which the RIS phases are kept fixed and only the
active beamformers are optimised. The average objective increases and the relative change in the weighted sum
